  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.0.295\n\n## Changes (initial history)\n\n- LW-2.1: add fixed-bank MBC1 world-read foundation (#307) (`bc0afbb`)\n- docs: link published Large Worlds target waves (#306) (`f3716ae`)\n- docs: make Large Worlds waves 2 and 3 executable (#295) (`0c51a3a`)\n- LW-1.5: add deterministic world budget diagnostics (#294) (`47ff91d`)\n- LW-1.4: compile Tiled worlds into deterministic WorldPack chunks (#293) (`fd3368d`)\n- LW-1.3: add the target-neutral WorldPack model (#292) (`7805406`)\n- LW-1.2: implement the widened collision-hit contract (#291) (`d040c54`)\n- LW-1.1: implement 16-bit world dimensions and camera lowering (#290) (`03fafea`)\n- LW-0.3: select NES Large Worlds cartridge profile (#289) (`7e576b5`)\n- LW-0.4: define 16-bit world coordinate contract (#288) (`c65c158`)\n- LW-0.2: define WorldPack v1 format (#287) (`55f0a06`)\n- LW-0.1: freeze full stage1 acceptance baseline (#286) (`ea74c65`)\n- docs: link Large Worlds execution issues (#285) (`72ccccf`)\n- docs: set up Large Worlds epic (#274) (`f867109`)\n- fix(gb): preserve left operand in 16-bit variable-vs-variable comparisons (#273) (`4deced3`)\n- fix(nes): refresh attributes when streaming background columns (#272) (`fab65e4`)\n- fix(runner/nes): shift screen-tall world up one tile row to clear bottom overscan (#271) (`4998e07`)\n- fix(runner): respect vertical map bounds via Camera.VerticalScrollMax() intrinsic (#270) (`edbfbfe`)\n- fix(runner/nes): restore full jump SFX so the NES jump no longer beeps (#269) (`4b705ed`)\n- runner: migrate to a stable stage1 map on the master 8-bit backend (#268) (`38869f7`)\n- SDKEXT-4/6/7: complete SDK plugin extensibility (epic #258) (#267) (`95f1668`)\n- Language/ABI: reject public pointer addressability forms (#266) (`7853164`)\n- Resolve #246: clarify raw target intrinsic quarantine (`03711d4`)\n- fix: route actor facade recognition through sdk roles (`06aac37`)\n- docs: define SDK plugin boundary (#255) (`fa50051`)\n- docs: classify target intrinsic taxonomy (`04e599c`)\n- docs: inventory compiler-owned SDK operations (#250) (`4c236f6`)\n- AF-5.8: harden actor TouchPlayer right-edge overlap (`5e59a5c`)\n- Clean up stale SDK alias test wording (`579ff70`)\n- Remove public SDK compatibility aliases (`dedd5f5`)\n- feat(nes): support PNG sprite overlays (#239) (`9e98d22`)\n- fix: align Game Boy vertical row streaming (`7973bd8`)\n- fix(gb): stop diagonal scroll corrupting the bottom rows on tall maps (#237) (`5042737`)\n- feat: tune runner run speed (`1e85672`)\n- fix(nes): restore the full pulse 1 state on SFX end (no duty/volume residue) (#235) (`d5a520a`)\n- fix(gb): play SFX on channel 1 with BGM priority (no music corruption) (#234) (`57e6317`)\n- NES: portable SFX action audio that plays cleanly over the BGM (#233) (`f6b295b`)\n- Projectiles: fix muzzle-flash glitch and add focused 2-shot cap samples (#232) (`201a323`)\n- Fix projectile follow-up issues (#231) (`a3bbe7c`)\n- feat(sdk): honor projectile Request direction (left/right) (#222) (#230) (`bf9279e`)\n- feat(sdk): portable projectile framework MVP (#220) (#228) (`cb1117b`)\n- runner: make the main loop readable via SimulatePlayer extraction (#221) (`529ab8c`)\n- feat: add NES DMC audio playback (#219) (`3042a8f`)\n- fix(codegen): preserve carry in 16-bit +=/-= with an i8 operand (nes/gb) (#218) (`d17a2f2`)\n- Remove loop keyword from language (#216) (`0e46c37`)\n- Resolve issues 210-214 (`26fb59c`)\n- chore: ignore local CodeGraph index (`1543c77`)\n- docs: validate source-only SDK library boundary (#209) (`74337fb`)\n- SDKAGN-5: rename SdkDotCallSyntax to generic QualifiedCallSyntax (#208) (`3389e5c`)\n- SDKAGN: make the compiler fully SDK-agnostic (retire SdkModuleRegistry) (#207) (`2717b86`)\n",
